# API base URL for the frontend axios client.
#
# Default (when this variable is unset): /api — same-origin, correct in
# production where the SPA is served by the same nginx that proxies /api/*
# to FastAPI.
#
# Override for non-prod work:
#   - Local dev against the VPS:
#       VITE_API_BASE=https://srv1575227.hstgr.cloud/api
#   - Local dev against a local backend on port 8000:
#       VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000/api
#
# DO NOT point this at omnioutreach.space — that domain is configured as
# an nginx server_name alias but has no DNS A record (NXDOMAIN). The only
# live HTTPS endpoint is srv1575227.hstgr.cloud. See
# omni-vault/wiki/architecture/system-overview.md.
VITE_API_BASE=
